# navigation/

Compose navigation graph for ${PROJECT_NAME}.

- `AppNavGraph.kt` — the single `NavHost` for the app. Add one `composable {}`
  block per screen.
- `Routes` object — centralised string route constants (alphabetised).

## Convention

Screens are decoupled from the navigator: pass typed lambdas
(e.g. `onItemClick: (id: String) -> Unit`) into the screen rather than the
NavController itself. Keeps screens testable without setting up a NavHost in
the test.

